window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-916e12c5bba5b9cc"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"long-running-work\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">长时间运行的工作</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code> 可获取对应 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>对于可能需要许多步骤才能完成的工作，请向 ChatGPT 清楚说明预期结果、约束条件和完成标准。相关工作尽量放在同一聊天中，这样 ChatGPT 就可以使用相同上下文来选择下一步，并判断工作何时完成。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中，输入 <code>/goal</code> 可启动“目标模式”。ChatGPT 工作期间，进度栏可让你暂停、恢复、编辑或清除目标。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>在 ChatGPT 网页版中开展托管的长时间任务时，请使用 ChatGPT Work，并在提示中直接写明预期结果、约束条件和审查标准。</p> <p>在同一个网页版聊天中继续交流，可以补充上下文、更改约束条件或询问进度。可以让互不依赖的任务在不同聊天中并行运行，但不要让两个任务同时获得对同一个已连接来源的写入权限。相关工作和源文件可以放在同一个<a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">项目</a>中。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：cli</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>在交互式 Codex CLI 会话中，输入 <code>/goal</code> 可启动“目标模式”。继续使用同一会话，可以引导工作方向或询问进度。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>在 IDE 扩展聊天中，输入 <code>/goal</code> 可针对当前打开的工作区启动“目标模式”。任务运行时，继续在同一聊天中交流，可以调整任务方向。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app</strong></p> <p>插图：ChatGPT 桌面应用中，输入框上方显示的目标进度控制项</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"start-a-goal\"></a> <a id=\"define-what-done-means\"></a> <a id=\"steer-a-running-goal\"></a> <a id=\"run-goals-in-parallel\"></a> <a id=\"related-docs\"></a></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"_2\">启动一个目标</h2> <p>在 ChatGPT 桌面应用、Codex CLI 或 IDE 扩展中输入 <code>/goal</code>。目标文本会同时成为任务的第一条提示和完成标准。</p> <p>如果预期结果还不够清晰，可以先输入 <code>/plan</code>。请 ChatGPT 通过提问了解你的需求、找出约束条件，并把结果整理成包含可衡量成功标准的目标。然后再用 <code>/goal</code> 启动完善后的目标。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app,web,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"_3\">定义完成标准</h2> <p>写出能让 ChatGPT 自行验证进度的目标。适用时，请包含以下三项：</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>目标要素</th> <th>应包含的内容</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>预期结果</strong></td> <td>描述你希望得到的结果，而不只是要求 ChatGPT 执行某项活动。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>约束条件</strong></td> <td>写明必须使用的工具、工作边界、兼容性需求或应避免的方法。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>验证方式</strong></td> <td>添加能够证明工作已完成的测试、度量指标或审查标准。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>例如：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Migrate this codebase from JavaScript to TypeScript. Preserve existing behavior,\ncompile in strict mode without explicit `any` types, and make the full test suite pass.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请将这个代码库从 JavaScript 迁移到 TypeScript。保持现有行为，在严格模式下编译，不使用显式的 `any` 类型，并让完整测试套件通过。</div></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"_4\">引导正在运行的目标</h2> <p>在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中，目标进度栏会显示在输入框上方。你可以通过它暂停或恢复工作、编辑目标或清除目标。目标运行期间，你也可以发送后续消息来补充上下文或调整约束条件。</p> <p>如果只想查看进度摘要或了解情况，又不想打断主聊天，可以使用侧边聊天。预计会断开连接时，请先暂停目标；准备好让 ChatGPT 继续工作时，再恢复目标。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"steer-a-running-task\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"steer-running-work\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">引导正在运行的工作</h2> <p>在同一聊天中继续交流，可以补充上下文、调整约束条件或询问进度摘要。只有当另一项任务能够独立运行时，才为它新建聊天。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：cli</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"steer-a-running-goal_1\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">引导正在运行的目标</h2> <p>在同一个交互式会话中发送后续消息，可以补充上下文或调整约束条件。希望 Codex 继续之前先总结进度时，可以询问进度摘要。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"steer-a-running-goal_2\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">引导正在运行的目标</h2> <p>在同一个 IDE 聊天中继续交流，可以补充上下文、调整约束条件或询问进度摘要。目标运行期间，请保持工作区可用。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>启动目标不会授予 ChatGPT 更广泛的访问权限。它仍遵循相同的<a href=\"#/article/a-668fd22585595004\">沙箱和审批策略</a>，并会在需要你作出决定时暂停。启用<a href=\"#/article/a-f464374c0d895ab1\">自动审批审查</a>后，可以由独立审查者评估符合条件的请求，但不会扩大原有边界。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"_8\">并行运行多个目标</h2> <p>每个聊天都有各自的上下文、消息、结果和目标。可以同时运行多个聊天，但不要让两个聊天修改同一组文件。使用 <a href=\"#/article/a-d955137d94c4d306\">worktree</a>，为并行进行的编码聊天提供彼此独立的检出目录。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>对于本地任务，请在设置中打开<strong>运行时禁止睡眠（Prevent sleep while running）</strong>，使 Mac 保持唤醒状态。你可以使用 <a href=\"#/article/a-74fe1167725e9c4d\">Pets</a> 或<a href=\"#/article/a-30bc4c9993999e92\">系统通知</a>，了解聊天何时需要你输入信息或已准备好接受审查。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"_9\">相关文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">项目和聊天</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=goal-mode\">目标模式和提示编写</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d955137d94c4d306\">Git worktree</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"related-docs_1\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_10\">相关文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">项目和聊天</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">计划任务</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-668fd22585595004\">沙箱和权限</a></li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"long-running-work\">Long-running work</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>For work that may take many steps, give ChatGPT a clear outcome, constraints, and definition of done. Keep related work in the same chat so ChatGPT can use the same context to choose the next step and decide when the work is complete.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>In the ChatGPT desktop app, enter <code>/goal</code> to start Goal mode. The progress row lets you pause, resume, edit, or clear the goal while ChatGPT works.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>For hosted long-running work in ChatGPT web, use ChatGPT Work and put the outcome, constraints, and review criteria directly in your prompt.</p> <p>Continue in the same web chat to add context, change constraints, or ask for a status update. Use separate chats when independent tasks can run in parallel, and avoid giving two tasks write access to the same connected source. For related work, keep the chats and source files together in a <a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">project</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: cli</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>In an interactive Codex CLI session, enter <code>/goal</code> to start Goal mode. Continue the same session to steer the work or ask for a status update.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>In the IDE extension chat, enter <code>/goal</code> to start Goal mode for the open workspace. Continue the same chat to steer the task while it runs.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app</strong></p> <p>Illustration: ChatGPT desktop app goal progress controls above the composer</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"start-a-goal\"></a> <a id=\"define-what-done-means\"></a> <a id=\"steer-a-running-goal\"></a> <a id=\"run-goals-in-parallel\"></a> <a id=\"related-docs\"></a></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"start-a-goal\">Start a goal</h2> <p>Type <code>/goal</code> in the ChatGPT desktop app, Codex CLI, or the IDE extension. The goal text becomes both the first prompt and the completion criteria for the task.</p> <p>If the outcome is still unclear, start with <code>/plan</code>. Ask ChatGPT to interview you, identify constraints, and turn the result into a goal with measurable success criteria. Then start the refined goal with <code>/goal</code>.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app,web,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"define-what-done-means\">Define what done means</h2> <p>Write a goal that lets ChatGPT verify its own progress. Include three things when they apply:</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Goal element</th> <th>What to include</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>Outcome</strong></td> <td>Describe the result you want, not only the activity ChatGPT should perform.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Constraints</strong></td> <td>Name required tools, boundaries, compatibility needs, or approaches to avoid.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Verification</strong></td> <td>Add tests, measurements, or review criteria that prove the work is complete.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>For example:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Migrate this codebase from JavaScript to TypeScript. Preserve existing behavior,\ncompile in strict mode without explicit `any` types, and make the full test suite pass.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"steer-a-running-goal\">Steer a running goal</h2> <p>In the ChatGPT desktop app, the goal progress row appears above the composer. Use it to pause or resume work, edit the goal, or clear it. You can also send follow-up messages while the goal runs to add context or adjust constraints.</p> <p>Use a side chat when you want a status recap or an explanation without interrupting the main chat. Pause the goal before you expect to lose connectivity, then resume it when you're ready for ChatGPT to continue.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"steer-a-running-task\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"steer-running-work\">Steer running work</h2> <p>Continue in the same chat to add context, adjust constraints, or ask for a status recap. Start a separate chat when another task can run independently.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: cli</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"steer-a-running-goal_1\">Steer a running goal</h2> <p>Send a follow-up message in the same interactive session to add context or adjust constraints. Ask for a status recap when you want Codex to summarize progress before it continues.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"steer-a-running-goal_2\">Steer a running goal</h2> <p>Continue in the same IDE chat to add context, adjust constraints, or ask for a status recap. Keep the workspace available while the goal is running.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>Starting a goal doesn't grant ChatGPT broader access. It keeps the same <a href=\"#/article/a-668fd22585595004\">sandbox and approval policy</a> and pauses when it needs a decision. With <a href=\"#/article/a-f464374c0d895ab1\">automatic approval reviews</a>, a separate reviewer can evaluate eligible requests without expanding those boundaries.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"run-goals-in-parallel\">Run goals in parallel</h2> <p>Each chat keeps its own context, messages, results, and goal. Run chats concurrently, but avoid letting two chats change the same files. Use <a href=\"#/article/a-d955137d94c4d306\">worktrees</a> to give parallel coding chats separate checkouts.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>For local work, turn on <strong>Prevent sleep while running</strong> in settings so your Mac stays awake. Use <a href=\"#/article/a-74fe1167725e9c4d\">Pets</a> or <a href=\"#/article/a-30bc4c9993999e92\">system notifications</a> to see when a chat needs input or is ready for review.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"related-docs\">Related docs</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">Projects and chats</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=goal-mode\">Goal mode and prompting</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d955137d94c4d306\">Git worktrees</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: web</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"related-docs_1\">Related docs</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">Projects and chats</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">Scheduled tasks</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-668fd22585595004\">Sandbox and permissions</a></li> </ul>"};
